            "review_title": "Review at Chivago Chicken Vietnam - Fried Chicken & Beer",
            "review_text": "Anh Amắn 🇻🇳\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam12939 contributions\n30\nFried Korean Chicken in Saigon\nOct 2022 • Friends\nWe popped in here for a meal purely by chance while walking past.\n\nThere is a variety of Korean influenced fried chicken dishes and beers to select from. We selected a chicken curry dish - similar to a chicken katsu, and chili boneless chicken pieces with chips. The dishes came with a selection of Korean condiments including a delicious kimchi. \n\nThe food was on the whole tasty and reasonably priced.\nRead more\nWritten October 5, 2022",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
