            "review_title": "Review at Chivago Chicken Vietnam - Fried Chicken & Beer",
            "review_text": "Pamela\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam2 contributions\n0\nShould Improve More\nOct 2020\nMy friend and I had lunch here on Sunday, a warm place where had 2 stairs, staffs were not really welcoming but I can sympathize. Let's straightforward to the dishes. We ordered a big bowl of fish cake and Galbi fried chicken but they were not amazing. I couldn't feel the tenderness of chicken's texture, it was crunchy outside which was good but inside of the chicken I felt lame. The taste of fish cake bowl was pretty strange or maybe I'm not a fan of that dish. There will be a lot of improvements for a chicken restaurant in D1.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten October 20, 2020",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
