            "review_title": "Review at Chivago Chicken Vietnam - Fried Chicken & Beer",
            "review_text": "cliff1608\nUnited Kingdom368 contributions\n0\nBad staff.\nDec 2019\nStopped here after being dropped off after tour about 15:30pm (29/12/19) so apart from another couple we were the only customers. The crispy fried chicken here was totally amazing and would definitely given the place full marks had it not been for the two lazy girls that were working there, they were just to busy txting and taking selfies on their phones for it to be enjoyable. Our sides ended up being starters as sooner than let them go cold while the girls were on instagram we ate them while we waited for our main dish to eventually arrive, we wanted another drink but again they were posing taking selfies and txting so in the end we got up and asked for the bill and for our food to go. Really is a shame because the food we had was really outstanding and tasty.\nRead more\nWritten December 29, 2019",
