            "review_text": "Mário R\nBern, Switzerland81 contributions\n1\nGreat chicken good beer!\nApr 2019 • Couples\nGot there and was surprised it was empty, i guess not so well known yet, but from the start the staff was really helpful and nice we ordered 3 half portions and that was to much seams expensive when you look atcthe price but its REALLY NOT! One hald portion a person will mostly do we ended up the meal super full, the chicken it self was amazing, very well seasoned and very well fried the garlic soy sauce chicken wings are amazing, i would go back just for those!! the standard beer selection is pretty good catering to all kinds of tastes and the craft beers are great!!\nRead more\nWritten April 18, 2019",
