            "review_title": "Review at Chivago Chicken Vietnam - Fried Chicken & Beer",
            "review_text": "SteveWelton\nPalawan Island, Philippines120 contributions\n1\nServing Excellence in Chicken.... and service.\nDec 2018 • Friends\nA friend and mine were in town after a photography trek across Australia and Japan. We were out and about just after Vietnam took the soccer Championship and we both were up for CHICKEN. We are so glad we came across this spot. If you are looking for a space with lot's of room to sit and enjoy some of the most epic chicken you have ever had this is your spot! The beer is cold. The owners and servers are all making sure you get what you want in a timely manner and care very much about making sure you leave with a smile. I highly recommend this place if you are looking for chicken in town. Don't be surprised if the owner greats you. Be sure to give this place a thumbs up and let me know how you enjoyed the meal! 5 Circles all day here!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten March 5, 2019\nNguyễn Hồng Mai\nThank you so much for your choice and your comment. Will glad to see you next time. \nSincerely Yours\nWritten March 7, 2019\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
